# Keep the build context small and the image free of host state. The Dockerfile
# only reads js/ (its manifests and the engine/gateway sources); everything else
# is run-time mounts, so it must not be shipped to the daemon.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/db
**/database/data
services/monitoring/data
reports
runtime-logs
_parity_js
_parity_py
writeups
**/*.log
